{"zone":{"id":2057,"name":"Scholomance","kind":"dungeon","entrance":{"zone":28,"x":69.7,"y":73.2},"levels":[58,60],"quests":{"A":11,"H":11}},"quests":[{"id":5529,"name":"Plagued Hatchlings","level":58,"minLevel":55,"side":"B","xp":6200,"text":"Kill 20 Plagued Hatchlings, then return to Betina Bigglezink at the Light's Hope Chapel.","start":{"npcs":[11035]},"end":{"npcs":[11035]},"objectives":[{"type":"npc","id":10678}],"elite":true,"next":5582,"zone":2057},{"id":5582,"name":"Healthy Dragon Scale","level":58,"minLevel":55,"side":"B","text":"Bring the Healthy Dragon Scale to Betina Bigglezink at the Light's Hope Chapel in Eastern Plaguelands.","start":{"items":[13920]},"end":{"npcs":[11035]},"givenItem":13920,"repeatable":true,"elite":true,"preAny":[5529],"zone":2057},{"id":5341,"name":"Barov Family Fortune","level":60,"minLevel":52,"side":"H","xp":6600,"text":"Venture to the Scholomance and recover the Barov family fortune. Four deeds make up this fortune: The Deed to Caer Darrow; The Deed to Brill; The Deed to Tarren Mill; and The Deed to Southshore. Return to Alexi Barov when you have completed this task.","start":{"npcs":[11022]},"end":{"npcs":[11022]},"objectives":[{"type":"item","id":13471},{"type":"item","id":13448},{"type":"item","id":13450},{"type":"item","id":13451}],"elite":true,"next":5342,"zone":2057},{"id":5343,"name":"Barov Family Fortune","level":60,"minLevel":52,"side":"A","xp":6600,"text":"Venture to the Scholomance and recover the Barov family fortune. Four deeds make up this fortune: The Deed to Caer Darrow; The Deed to Brill; The Deed to Tarren Mill; and The Deed to Southshore. Return to Weldon Barov when you have completed this task.","start":{"npcs":[11023]},"end":{"npcs":[11023]},"objectives":[{"type":"item","id":13471},{"type":"item","id":13448},{"type":"item","id":13450},{"type":"item","id":13451}],"elite":true,"notes":["You get all four deeds by clicking objects inside the Scholomance dungeon, which needs a group and a key."],"next":5344,"zo