 quest and Vectus is elite, so bring a group."],"preAny":[5531],"zone":2057},{"id":5466,"name":"The Lich, Ras Frostwhisper","level":60,"minLevel":57,"side":"B","xp":9950,"text":"Find Ras Frostwhisper in the Scholomance. When you have found him, use the Soulbound Keepsake on his undead visage. Should you succeed in reverting him to a mortal, strike him down and recover the Human Head of Ras Frostwhisper. Take the head back to Magistrate Marduke.","start":{"npcs":[11286]},"end":{"npcs":[11286]},"objectives":[{"type":"item","id":13626}],"givenItem":13752,"rewards":[13982,13984,13986,14002],"elite":true,"notes":["Ras is an elite boss in Scholomance and needs a dungeon group."],"preAny":[5465],"zone":2057},{"id":5531,"name":"Betina Bigglezink","level":60,"minLevel":57,"side":"B","xp":1650,"text":"Bring the Frozen Eggs to Betina Bigglezink.","start":{"npcs":[11036]},"end":{"npcs":[11035]},"givenItem":13761,"elite":true,"notes":["You get the Frozen Eggs from the previous quest in the chain (5522). You need them in your bags to turn this in."],"preAny":[5522],"next":4771,"zone":2057},{"id":8969,"name":"The Left Piece of Lord Valthalak's Amulet","level":60,"minLevel":58,"side":"B","xp":8300,"text":"Use the Brazier of Beckoning to summon forth the spirit of Kormok and slay him. Return to Bodley inside Blackrock Mountain with the Left Piece of Lord Valthalak's Amulet and the Brazier of Beckoning.","start":{"npcs":[16033]},"end":{"npcs":[16033]},"objectives":[{"type":"npc","id":16118},{"type":"item","id":21984}],"givenItem":22052,"elite":true,"preAny":[8962,8963,8964,8965],"exclusiveTo":[8966,8967,8968],"next":8970,"zone":2057},{"id":8992,"name":"The Right Piece of Lord Valthalak's Amulet","level":60,"minLevel":58,"side":"B","xp":8300,"text":"Use the Brazier of Beckoning to summon forth the spirit of Kormok and slay him. Return to Bodley inside Blackrock Mountain with the recombined Lord Valthalak's Amulet and the Brazier of Beckoning.","start":{"npcs":[16033]},"end":{"npcs":[1